# Implementation Plan - Phase 12: Advanced Learning Features

This phase introduces secondary learning features, local-only backup systems, and payment provider integrations on the mobile app and backend.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Unified Payment Provider Mocks:** We will implement a unified `PaymentProvider` interface in the mobile app with adapters for Google Play, Cafe Bazaar, Myket, and Direct Payment Gateway. For demonstration/testing, the UI will display a mock payment popup prompting the user to complete the payment. Upon completion, a request is sent to the backend `/purchases` endpoint to record the purchase as `COMPLETED`.

> [!NOTE]
> **Offline Backup File Location:** Due to target platform filesystem variations, the offline backup file will be written to the app's documents directory (e.g. `leitner_backup.enc`). In the Settings page, we will provide a list of available backups found in that directory, letting users easily export/overwrite new ones or select an existing one to import.

## Open Questions

- *None at this stage. All requirements align with the UI design specification and database schemas.*

