## Proposed Changes

### Backend Component

We need to add a public/authenticated purchase endpoint that mobile clients hit to record and verify purchases.

#### [NEW] [PurchaseController.cs](file:///e:/projects/leitner-learning-platform/backend/LeitnerPlatform.API/Controllers/v1/PurchaseController.cs)
- Implement `POST /api/v1/purchases` endpoint:
  - Requires authentication.
  - Takes `course_id`, `payment_provider`, and `transaction_id`.
  - Inserts/updates a `Purchase` record with `Status = "COMPLETED"`.
  - Publishes `PurchaseCompletedEvent` on the backend Event Bus (this automatically triggers the off-server S3 backup replication).
  - Returns the purchase details.

